# CP6 (docs/research/story-cp5-19.md §6): from CP5's end at the Valley Windworks,
# Route 205 South, Eterna Forest with Cheryl (a partner wild double, type 74, in the grass; Jack and Briana,
# then Lindsey and Elijah, by VS2 with her: 75), Eterna's statue scene and HM01, Gardenia blocking the gym
# door, the Eterna Gym (the flower clock; 324, 259, 260, Gardenia 315), Cut, the Galactic Eterna Building
# (Looker, Jupiter 406), to the Rad Rickshaw back in the Cycle Shop.
# Real battles only (no `party` lines). Trainers that look or walk at random over the only way are battled
# where the player waits in a line they turn or walk into (`until message`), so every seed fights them.
# Team plan (cp5's header): Prinplup alone carries the chunk. Gardenia's three all know Grass Knot, so it is
# levelled in Eterna Forest with Cheryl, who heals the party after every battle, to 36: Empoleon (steel
# takes Grass Knot neutrally). HM01 Cut goes over Bubble Beam (Rock Smash is an HM move and stays).
